{"schemaVersion":1,"reviewId":"canonical-chemistry-q1-soaps","ruleVersion":"semantic-atomicity-v1","landscapeId":"c436b994-8f44-5134-b9f8-0c9f5d6a5ba0","goalId":"1837690e-cfb1-5b1c-96c8-0fb40d6d5d69","fingerprint":"sha256:13a2aba3c44a04d4d35ced8c6c895b9d4f49b9161e7886f92a3c80198cdbf923","status":"atomic","semanticAtomic":true,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-05","reviewer":"Codex independent seven current A/M scientific review","reason":"One washing-system model relates controlled changes of temperature, water hardness and concentration to dispersal, micelles and insoluble hardness soaps. The factors are conditions of the same competence; no universal optimum, arbitrary titration or unrelated experimental routine is added.","suggestedSplit":[]}
{"schemaVersion":1,"reviewId":"canonical-chemistry-q1-soaps","ruleVersion":"semantic-atomicity-v1","landscapeId":"c436b994-8f44-5134-b9f8-0c9f5d6a5ba0","goalId":"8a491e3b-5d0b-51d3-9b14-0977ec035dd6","fingerprint":"sha256:e0063176d9aa813404a7440417fb80fff4120efdf3d967eaa27399b411fc7513","status":"atomic","semanticAtomic":true,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-05","reviewer":"Codex independent seven current A/M scientific review","reason":"A single water-hardness model distinguishes temporary, permanent and total hardness and explains suitable removal mechanisms. The title no longer promises an unrequired complexometric quantification; total hardness is restored. The specified calcium heating model does not imply universal MgCO3 formation, and ion exchange is not desalination.","suggestedSplit":[]}
{"schemaVersion":1,"reviewId":"canonical-chemistry-q1-soaps","ruleVersion":"semantic-atomicity-v1","landscapeId":"c436b994-8f44-5134-b9f8-0c9f5d6a5ba0","goalId":"d742ecb0-0795-5446-a95d-9503d4618475","fingerprint":"sha256:6e1298e46242f31d86dc342aba66ba6926cdebf9032910e39ecb14799e24fff5","status":"atomic","semanticAtomic":true,"reviewedAt":"2026-10-05T21:06:41.847481+00:00","reviewer":"independent_machine_scientific_review_after_actual_current_text_context_source_and_image_reads","reason":"Der Kompetenzkern ist die kontrollierte, begründete Untersuchung von Tensidleistung. CMC-, Schaum- und Schmutztragemessung sind abgestimmte Indikatoren desselben Vergleichs mit gemeinsamen Kontrollen und Grenzen; Planen, Durchführen und Bewerten sind Phasen dieses einen experimentellen Kompetenzschritts. Eine reine Planung oder ein einzelner isolierter Messwert genügt ausdrücklich nicht zur Beherrschung. Actual independent frozen decision: curricula/DE/Gymnasium/quality/goal-evidence/2026-10-05/chemie-q1-seven-source-operator-current-independent-d-a-v1/independent-current-a7-m7.scientific-decisions.json.","suggestedSplit":[]}
